          "“Trying” assumes opportunity: roughly regular ovulation chances and intercourse (or insemination) without long gaps that remove those chances. If periods are missing or highly irregular, the usual month-count is a poor fit—you may not be releasing eggs often enough for another quiet year to mean much. Ovulation-tracking details belong in our ovulation tracking guide."
